OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMost showers
OL,6,Feasing through the evening, becoming
OL,7,Fmore confined to the north of the
OL,8,Fregion. Patchy cloud for all, and a
OL,9,Fmild night for many.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FAny showers in the morning
OL,12,Fwill fade away, as cloud lifts and
OL,13,Fbreaks into the afternoon. Becoming
OL,14,Fdry, with sunny spells. Pleasantly
OL,15,Fwarm for all.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
